abstract: >-
  Model Study Bridge (MSB) is an experimental protocol research project for
  interoperable and auditable deliberation between heterogeneous AI models.
  It studies typed public artifacts, explicit evidence provenance, immutable
  history, privacy boundaries, and verifiable decision closure without
  requiring disclosure of private chain-of-thought.
